PN,31802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1785633476
OL,3,COlivia Dean and Sam Fender break 1950s
OL,4,Crecord after 19 weeks at number one
OL,6,FAward-winning musician Fender, who was
OL,7,Fpresented with an Official Chart
OL,8,Frecord breaker award to commemorate
OL,9,Fthe feat, said: "Completely lost for
OL,10,Fwords.
OL,12,F"Thank you so much to Olivia Dean and
OL,13,Fthe fans for making this song the
OL,14,Fjuggernaut that it is. Can't believe
OL,15,Fwe broke the UK record!"
OL,17,FNumber ones are calculated far
OL,18,Fdifferently now than they were in
OL,19,F1953, which were a simple tally of the
OL,20,Fmost sold records at various retailers.
OL,26,@qD@QOUtD@AOUwD@XO]
