OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1785633476
OL,3,COlivia Dean and Sam Fender break 1950s
OL,4,Crecord after 19 weeks at number one
OL,6,FNowadays the charts combine physical
OL,7,Fand download sales with audio and
OL,8,Fvideo streams, using daily data from a
OL,9,Fvariety of sources, calculating them
OL,10,Fthroughout the week.
OL,12,FBecca Monahan and Chris Austin,
OL,13,Finterim co-managing directors at the
OL,14,FOfficial Charts Company, said the
OL,15,Frecord-breaking feat "feels especially
OL,16,Fsignificant" coming from "two
OL,17,Fhomegrown British artists".
OL,26,@wD@VOUxD@LO]xD@ZOUyD@ZO]
