OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1785633476
OL,3,COlivia Dean and Sam Fender break 1950s
OL,4,Crecord after 19 weeks at number one
OL,6,F"At a time when UK artists are
OL,7,Fcompeting on a truly global stage,
OL,8,Fthis is a fantastic moment to
OL,9,Fcelebrate British creativity ` and a
OL,10,Frecord-breaking number one that will
OL,11,Fnow sit proudly in the history books,"
OL,12,Fthey added.
OL,14,FRein Me In, which was crowned song of
OL,15,Fthe year at the Brit Awards 2026,
OL,16,Frecently made chart history as the
OL,17,Flongest-running number one single of
OL,18,Fall time by a British act.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@fO]
