CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1785633476
OL,3,COlivia Dean and Sam Fender break 1950s
OL,4,Crecord after 19 weeks at number one
OL,6,FThe hit track has also fuelled Dean's
OL,7,Frapid rise to stardom, which has led
OL,8,Fto major wins at the Grammys, Brits
OL,9,Fand Mobos.
OL,11,FOn the albums chart, Charli XCX is
OL,12,Falso making history as the first
OL,13,FBritish female artist to earn two
OL,14,Fnumber one albums in the same year.
OL,16,FCharli XCX has joined the likes of The
OL,17,FBeatles, David Bowie, Elton John and
OL,18,FEd Sheeran in achieving the feat with
OL,19,Fher latest record Music, Fashion,
OL,20,FFilm, which was released on Friday.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/6
