OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1785633476
OL,3,COlivia Dean and Sam Fender break 1950s
OL,4,Crecord after 19 weeks at number one
OL,6,FIt marks her fourth number one record
OL,7,Fand joins her Wuthering Heights
OL,8,Fcompanion album to Emerald Fennell's
OL,9,Ffilm of the same name, which reached
OL,10,Fthe top spot in February.
OL,12,FMusic, Fashion, Film has also topped
OL,13,Fthe UK vinyl albums chart for the most
OL,14,Fphysical records sold.
